    illustrationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8214adf1f9584d458050d494a1c7d53, type: 3}
  - pageTitle: Troop Placement
    pageDescription: Position your units onto valid grid tiles. Strategically place
      your troops to form effective line defenses and attack paths.
